2><ul><li>You may request a withdrawal at any time, subject to available (non-traded) balance.</li><li>Withdrawals are returned to the same method used to deposit where possible.</li><li>Standard processing time: within 24 hours for approval; the payment network may add 1–5 business days depending on method.</li><li>Withdrawal requests may be delayed or declined if KYC is incomplete or the request is flagged for review.</li></ul><h2>4. Refund Eligibility</h2><h3>4.1 Un-traded deposits</h3><p>If you deposited funds and have not placed any trades, you may request a refund to the original payment method within <strong>14 days</strong> of the deposit. Payment provider or network fees are non-refundable.</p><h3>4.2 Traded funds</h3><p>Once funds are used to place a trade, they represent the result of a financial transaction and are <strong>not refundable</strong>. Losses incurred through trading are not eligible for refund.</p><h3>4.3 Paid services (funded challenges, VIP, add-ons)</h3><p>Paid services are refundable within <strong>7 days</strong> of purchase provided the service has <strong>not been used</strong> (e.g. no trades placed on a funded challenge, VIP features not accessed). Once the service has been used, the fee is non-refundable.</p><h3>4.4 Duplicate or erroneous charges</h3><p>Duplicate or clearly erroneous charges are refunded in full upon verification.</p><h2>5. Cancellation</h2><p>You may cancel any subscription or recurring service from your account dashboard at any time. Cancellation stops future billing; already-paid periods are not pro-rated unless required by law.</p><h2>6. Processing Times</h2><ul><li>Refund request review: within 3 business days.</li><li>Approved refunds initiated: within 5 business days.</li><li>Time to appear on your card/wallet: additional 1–10 business days depending on provider.</li></ul><h2>7. How to Request a Refund</h2><p>Send a request to <a href="mailto:support@okaybroker.com">support@okaybroker.com</a> with:</p><ul><li>Registered email address on your account.</li><li>Transaction ID and date.</li><li>Payment method used.</li><li>Reason for the refund request.</li></ul><h2>8. Chargebacks &amp; Disputes</h2><p>Please contact us first before opening a chargeback with your bank or payment provider — we can usually resolve issues faster directly. Fraudulent or abusive chargebacks may result in permanent account closure and legal action to recover funds.</p><h2>9. Fraud, AML &amp; Non-Compliance</h2><p>We reserve the right to withhold, reverse or refund a transaction if we detect fraud, money laundering, sanctions issues, bonus abuse or a breach of our Terms. Such actions are taken in accordance with applicable law.</p><h2>10. Service Availability</h2><p>We aim for high availability but do not guarantee uninterrupted service. Scheduled maintenance, force majeure or third-party outages may cause temporary unavailability. We are not liable for missed trading opportunities during such periods.</p><h2>11. Contact</h2><p>Refunds &amp; billing: <a href="mailto:billing@okaybroker.com">billing@okaybroker.com</a><br/>General support: <a href="mailto:support@okaybroker.com">support@okaybroker.com</a></p></article></main><footer class="border-t border-border bg-panel/30"><div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-12 md:px-8"><div class="grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-4"><div><div class="text-sm font-bold">Okay Broker</div><p class="mt-3 text-xs leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Premium binary options trading platform with 30+ OTC markets, demo &amp; live accounts, funded programs and an affiliate network.</p></div><div><div class="mb-3 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-muted-foreground">Company</div><ul class="space-y-2 text-sm"><li><a href="about" class="hover:text-primary">About Us</a></li><li><a href="services" class="hover:text-primary">Services</a></li><li><a href="funded" class="hover:text-primary">Funded Accounts</a></li><li><a href="affiliate" class="hover:text-primary">Affiliate 